I just went to the HO Retail PO (2701 Riverside Dr, Ottawa) around 9:20AM and re-tested with the following prod DSS587354516169.  And confirmed that when the clerk enters/scans the DSS barcode, on the following screen (Complete Customer Proofing screen), the clerks scans the customer's driver's license, only the ID Number field is populated.   It should also be adding the information in the following fields: Customer Photo ID and Photo ID Issued by (as this info is available in the barcode).  Also, it should be providing the "Confirm Verification" suggestion (ie No match, Match, etc).  Attaching the screen.

